{"id":"n68574-2-8","stage":5,"title":"예년 · 常年","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68574-2-8-1","ko":"요즘 너무 더운 것 같아. 봄 같지가 않아.","zh":"最近好像太热了，完全不像是春天啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"더운","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운","audio":"/audio/2d08b046799650114bd9.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","explanation":"것：前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"봄","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}},{"text":"같지가","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같지가","audio":"/audio/51ac9f82048681852c33.mp3"}},{"text":"않아.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아","audio":"/audio/691c8d98a5312caac1ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/91e29cbcf92c5dd7be82.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68574-2-8-2","ko":"내일은 예년 기온을 회복한다네요.","zh":"据说明天气温会恢复到往年水平。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일은","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일은","audio":"/audio/a7181639ea1108daa648.mp3"}},{"text":"예년","meaning":"常年，平年","explanation":"예년：常年，平年","readings":[{"term":"예년","audio":"/audio/d1c31bb5f97d891b7a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68574","senseId":"2","lemma":"예년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예년","audio":"/audio/d1c31bb5f97d891b7a20.mp3"}},{"text":"기온을","meaning":"气温","explanation":"기온：气温；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기온","audio":"/audio/48d003e07a2183c4aa32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38103","senseId":"1","lemma":"기온","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기온을","audio":"/audio/7d8b2bd6849c87074009.mp3"}},{"text":"회복한다네요.","meaning":"恢复，找回，重树，重塑；表示引用。","explanation":"회복하다：恢复，找回，重树，重塑；하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"회복하다","audio":"/audio/90ee2c68787b61b8ba4c.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60170","senseId":"2","lemma":"회복하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회복한다네요","audio":"/audio/124c51364b326578208a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"d1c31bb5f97d891b","term":"예년","zh":"常年，平年","audio":"/audio/d1c31bb5f97d891b7a20.mp3","entryId":"68574","definition":"在天气预报中，过去三十年间天气的平均状态。","pronunciation":["예ː년"]},{"id":"48d003e07a2183c4","term":"기온","zh":"气温","audio":"/audio/48d003e07a2183c4aa32.mp3","entryId":"38103","definition":"大气的温度。","pronunciation":["기온"]},{"id":"90ee2c68787b61b8","term":"회복하다","zh":"恢复，找回，重树，重塑","audio":"/audio/90ee2c68787b61b8ba4c.mp3","entryId":"60170","definition":"把失去的东西重新找回，或使恶化的东西回到原来的状态。","pronunciation":["회보카다","훼보카다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b25e0f93cbc70207102f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68574","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说明天气温会恢复到往年水平。","最近好像太热了，完全不像是春天啊。","听说发生了事故？有没有哪里受伤？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近好像太热了，完全不像是春天啊。","听说发生了事故？有没有哪里受伤？","据说明天气温会恢复到往年水平。"],"answer":2}]}
